WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.523
- Well, last time I saw you was over Zoom.

00:00:02.523 --> 00:00:05.170
It's been a really weird year.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.110
- Very, very weird.
- Yeah.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.350
- Let me tell you what
just happened to me.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.730
So, I just got home and
I went to go start my car

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:17.730
and something crawled in
my engine and built a nest.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.683
- What?
- Like a nest,

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.240
look, a nest in my engine.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.330
Look at that.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.320
They said it's squirrels because it was,

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.360
I mean, it was, look, I don't know where

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.019
they got toilet paper
from, like that was weird--

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:34.170
- I don't know, but a lot of people

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:36.660
have been looking for it. (laughs)

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:37.840
The squirrels got it.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.350
- Like twigs, nuts, I mean--

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.720
- Kind of hard to get rid of that?

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.910
- Yeah, I had to like vacuum
all the nuts and twigs out,

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:47.000
like that was crazy.
- All the hard work

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.690
that squirreled did, you just--

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.220
- But look, I hear it's a thing,

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.166
'cause like I went online and told people

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:52.999
and the people was like,

00:00:52.999 --> 00:00:54.470
"Yeah, that just happened
to me two weeks ago."

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:55.311
And I'm just like, "What?"

00:00:55.311 --> 00:00:56.144
- [Kelly] That's not a thing.

00:00:56.144 --> 00:00:59.120
I don't feel like that's a thing.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.187
- Everybody's like, "Oh, relax.

00:01:00.187 --> 00:01:01.477
"Just vacuum it out.

00:01:01.477 --> 00:01:03.570
"Hopefully, your wires wasn't chewed up."

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:06.920
And I was just like,
"Okay, all right, yeah."

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.077
Wow, right?

